			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 100100501,
					"content": "Alright, that's the Hilichurls and barriers all taken care of...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100502,
					"content": "And we didn't set the forest on fire.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100503,
					"content": "I was extra careful with Jumpy Dumpty!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100504,
					"content": "I've been getting sent to confinement less and less these days!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100505,
					"content": "Nice job, Klee!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100506,
					"content": "Maybe sometime soon, you won't have to go at all...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100507,
					"content": "Well, if Master Jean would just let Klee blow the confinement room up...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100508,
					"content": "That's not really what Paimon had in mind... Wait, what about the trial? Did we learn anything new?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100509,
					"content": "Yep! I found this in the hole Jumpy Dumpty created after exploding...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100510,
					"content": "Huh, another note.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100511,
					"content": "Yup, and it's mom's handwriting again...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100512,
					"content": "\"Now then, Dodoco may or may not have blasted all the hurdles away — though the most direct approach is sometimes the most elegant one. Either way, thus did Dodoco make it to the second stage of the trial...\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100513,
					"content": "\"Which, coincidentally, was also the final stage. Even the most energetic of children need to pace themselves, after all. So...\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100514,
					"content": "\"Dodoco proceeded to the banks of a lake of fallen stars, passed the final trial, and obtained her reward. But could things really be that simple...?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100515,
					"content": "Huh, \"a lake of fallen stars\"... That must be Starfell Lake!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100516,
					"content": "Let's go see what we can find.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100517,
					"content": "Alright!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						100100518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Klee"
				},
				{
					"id": 100100518,
					"content": "Paimon's super curious about what this reward's gonna be. Fingers crossed for some kind of awesome treasure!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
